# https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. Adapts jank-lang/clojure-test-suite for the Suss harness:
# :suss branches use a core type, (type []), where the hierarchy tests name a host
# class (js/String, js/Object, String, Object), and select Clojure's assertion that
# descendants of a protocol is nil (#30); the recorded observation is corrected in
# tests/oracle/clojure-test-suite-corrections.json. Suss types have no supertypes, so
# the type-inheritance assertions keep the ClojureScript branches that skip them.
